  "claude": {
    "enabled": true,
    "research": {
      "notes": "**Rubrik (RBRK), 2026-09-29 to 2026-10-29**\n\n**1. Guidance and results**\n- Rubrik issued no new guidance or pre-announcement in the window. I found nothing in the window on raised, cut or withdrawn guidance.\n- Context from before the window: on 2026-08-27 Rubrik raised all guided FY27 metrics. These were revenue of $1.685–1.693B, free cash flow of $323–333M and non-GAAP EPS of $0.47–0.53. — 2026-08-27 — https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/RBRK/8-k-rubrik-inc-reports-material-event-8842c5be7e05.html\n- Q2 revenue was $427.3M against a consensus of about $396.3M. — 2026-08-27 — https://www.defenseworld.net/2026/10/28/rubrik-inc-rbrk-stock-bought-by-citizens-financial-group-inc-ri.html\n- Next earnings are scheduled for 2026-12-03. — date unknown (scheduled report) — https://stockinvest.us/earnings-report/RBRK\n\n**2. Analyst actions**\n- Morgan Stanley (Meta Marshall) reportedly upgraded to Overweight with a $155 price target. This comes from a single aggregator source (GuruFocus) and I could not find a primary or major-outlet confirmation. — 2026-10-29 — https://www.gurufocus.com/news/9150440/rbrk-initiates-coverage-on-rubrik-rating-upgraded-to-overweight\n- Wedbush raised its price target to $150 from $120 and kept Outperform. It cited Rubrik's discounting to gain share, mid-20% revenue growth through FY29, and free cash flow estimates 12% above consensus. — 2026-10-26 — https://www.gurufocus.com/news/9142306/wedbush-raises-price-target-on-rubrik-rbrk-amid-strong-growth-outlook (also https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/analyst-rubrik-nyse-rbrk-stock-price-expected-to-rise-wedbush-analyst-says-2026-10-26/)\n- Baird raised its price target to $139 from $130 and kept Outperform. The aggregator page doesn't give the date. — date unknown — https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/rbrk/\n- Consensus figures differ by source:\n  - MarketBeat: average target $114.42 (29 brokerages, 28 Buy and 1 Sell) — date unknown — https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/consensus-rubrik-inc-nyse-rbrk-stock-has-average-price-target-of-11442-2026-10-12/\n  - MarketBeat, later: $116.67 — date unknown — https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/analyst-rubrik-nyse-rbrk-stock-price-expected-to-rise-wedbush-analyst-says-2026-10-26/\n  - Yahoo Finance: $121.26 — date unknown — https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RBRK/\n\n**3. Litigation and regulation**\n- I found no new lawsuits, investigations, fines, export-control actions or approvals in the window. My search returned only old items, such as the 2020 patent suits.\n\n**4. Customer concentration**\n- I found no material customer win, loss or contract change in the window, and no concentration disclosure.\n- Context from before the window: 2,805 customers had $100K+ in subscription ARR and generated 87% of subscription ARR. — 2026-03-12 — https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/rubrik-rbrk-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/\n\n**5. Insider activity**\n- Director John W. Thompson sold 13,500 Class A shares under a 10b5-1 plan, at about $114.68–$116.47 per share. The sales were split between the direct account and a family trust, following a 11,000-share conversion. — 2026-10-01 — https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001943896/000120743326000022/form4-10022026_091056.xml\n  - This continues a monthly pattern: his Form 4s show sales on 2026-07-01, 2026-08-03 and 2026-09-01 — https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001943896/000120743326000020/form4-09042026_120923.xml\n- Director Yvonne Wassenaar sold 721 shares at $119 under a 10b5-1 plan adopted 2025-12-15. — 2026-10-05 — https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001943896/000170774426000023/form4-10062026_091053.xml\n- CEO Bipul Sinha entered a prepaid variable forward contract on 500,000 shares with Goldman Sachs. It carries a $42.05M upfront payment, a floor of $93.14 and a cap of $165.58, and settles 2028-09-26. He also gifted 55,000 shares. The earliest transaction date is just before the window opens, but the Form 4 and Form 144 were filed in it. — 2026-09-24 — https://www.thefilingfool.com/filing/0001685768-26-000003\n  - Form 144 values the 500,000 shares at $56.9M, with an estimated sale date of 2026-09-25 — https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/RBRK/144-rubrik-inc-sec-filing-f438d63cf011.html\n- An aggregator reports $17.3M of insider sales over the last three months. I did not verify this against filings. — date unknown — https://www.gurufocus.com/news/9150440/rbrk-initiates-coverage-on-rubrik-rating-upgraded-to-overweight\n- I found no insider purchases. The CFO's most recent Form 4 in my results covers 2026-09-15 to 2026-09-17, before the window. I did not find any CFO filings from October. — 2026-09-15 — https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001943896/000202022026000022/form4-09182026_010913.xml\n\n**6. Product and competitive news**\n- Rubrik expanded its Project Hourglass alliance and introduced Rubrik Code Guardian, which runs Anthropic's Claude Mythos 5 against air-gapped copies of customer code repositories. AHEAD, Trace3 and WWT joined the alliance. — 2026-10-09 — https://www.rubrik.com/company/newsroom/press-releases/26/rubrik-expands-project-hourglass-with-rubrik-code-guardian-powered-by-claude\n  - Code Guardian is in private preview and not generally available. — 2026-10-09 — https://www.channelinsider.com/security/rubrik-project-hourglass-code-guardian-ai/\n- Wedbush says Rubrik is using strategic discounting to gain share. This is an analyst view, not a company statement. — 2026-10-26 — https://www.gurufocus.com/news/9142306/wedbush-raises-price-target-on-rubrik-rbrk-amid-strong-growth-outlook\n- I found no pricing changes, delays or new-competitor news in the window.",
